{
  "watching": {
    "start": "00:28:08,406",
    "end": "00:33:52,950"
  },
  "fullSubtitles": [
    {
      "start": "00:28:08,406",
      "end": "00:28:10,274",
      "text": "I'm sure of this. Write it down."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:10,308",
      "end": "00:28:11,676",
      "text": "- Mm, okay. - Wait, wait."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:11,709",
      "end": "00:28:13,945",
      "text": "Stop your clicky-clacky. I have a better idea."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:13,978",
      "end": "00:28:15,847",
      "text": "Uh, you can't keep changing your mind."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:15,880",
      "end": "00:28:17,048",
      "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:17,082",
      "end": "00:28:18,883",
      "text": "Why? Because in exactly 20 minutes,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:18,916",
      "end": "00:28:22,019",
      "text": "the stage crew are coming here to start work on our show,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:22,054",
      "end": "00:28:24,056",
      "text": "and we need to lock this stuff down."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:24,089",
      "end": "00:28:26,891",
      "text": "Oh, my gosh, they're early."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:26,924",
      "end": "00:28:29,460",
      "text": "Ooh, and I want to have, like, this beautiful love scene..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:29,494",
      "end": "00:28:31,496",
      "text": "Miss Crawly, anything on Calloway?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:31,529",
      "end": "00:28:33,798",
      "text": "- Hmm, not a thing. - Oh, geez."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:36,667",
      "end": "00:28:37,802",
      "text": "Ah, Mr. Moon."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:37,835",
      "end": "00:28:39,904",
      "text": "We're your production team, and we're here to start..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:39,937",
      "end": "00:28:42,740",
      "text": "Yes, yes, yes. Uh, you're here to work on the show."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:42,774",
      "end": "00:28:45,042",
      "text": "And I would gladly invite you all in right now, but..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:45,077",
      "end": "00:28:47,345",
      "text": "We should totally do, like, a battle scene!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:47,378",
      "end": "00:28:49,514",
      "text": "Gunter, no, not now."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:49,547",
      "end": "00:28:51,616",
      "text": "I just need a little more time to, you know,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:51,649",
      "end": "00:28:54,452",
      "text": "hammer out a few minor, little details, so would it be okay"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:54,485",
      "end": "00:28:56,454",
      "text": "if you all could come back in, like,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:56,487",
      "end": "00:28:58,356",
      "text": "I don't know, an hour? Or maybe four?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:28:58,389",
      "end": "00:29:00,424",
      "text": "And I really appreciate your patience."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:00,458",
      "end": "00:29:01,859",
      "text": "Thank you so much."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:01,893",
      "end": "00:29:03,795",
      "text": "Hmm. Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:03,828",
      "end": "00:29:06,397",
      "text": "Okay. That was not a great start."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:06,430",
      "end": "00:29:09,734",
      "text": "- Oh, look, it's a gift from Mr. Crystal. - Huh."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:09,767",
      "end": "00:29:11,536",
      "text": "It-it says, um,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:11,569",
      "end": "00:29:14,405",
      "text": "\"Don't screw up, Moon, or else.\""
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:14,438",
      "end": "00:29:16,108",
      "text": "Ooh, I've got a better idea."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:16,141",
      "end": "00:29:18,110",
      "text": "♪ What about the mambo? ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:18,143",
      "end": "00:29:20,078",
      "text": "♪ And everyone's in space suits ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:20,112",
      "end": "00:29:21,946",
      "text": "♪ A great idea, I think so. ♪"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:26,951",
      "end": "00:29:28,653",
      "text": "Good morning."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:28,686",
      "end": "00:29:31,689",
      "text": "May I have everyone's attention, please?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:31,722",
      "end": "00:29:33,558",
      "text": "Thank you. Yes."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:33,591",
      "end": "00:29:36,427",
      "text": "Okay, um, on behalf of myself and the cast,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:36,460",
      "end": "00:29:37,829",
      "text": "I just want to say that"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:37,862",
      "end": "00:29:39,964",
      "text": "to be given this incredible opportunity"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:39,997",
      "end": "00:29:42,600",
      "text": "to work with you all here at the Crystal Tower Theater,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:42,633",
      "end": "00:29:44,535",
      "text": "well, it's an honor for all of us."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:44,569",
      "end": "00:29:46,838",
      "text": "And I believe that, together, we can make a show"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:46,871",
      "end": "00:29:48,906",
      "text": "that'll take the audience out of this world."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:51,409",
      "end": "00:29:53,511",
      "text": "And a big thanks to Steve over here"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:53,544",
      "end": "00:29:55,446",
      "text": "for staying up all night to make this model."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:55,479",
      "end": "00:29:56,881",
      "text": "Great work, Steve."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:56,914",
      "end": "00:29:58,916",
      "text": "And here she is, folks."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:29:58,950",
      "end": "00:30:01,552",
      "text": "The star of our show, Rosita."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:01,586",
      "end": "00:30:03,888",
      "text": "That's you, baby!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:03,921",
      "end": "00:30:05,489",
      "text": "The lead role?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:05,523",
      "end": "00:30:07,625",
      "text": "Trust me, you are perfect for it."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:09,527",
      "end": "00:30:11,129",
      "text": "Wait till my kids hear about this."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:11,163",
      "end": "00:30:13,131",
      "text": "And so the story goes like this."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:13,165",
      "end": "00:30:15,466",
      "text": "Rosita plays an astronaut searching"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:15,499",
      "end": "00:30:17,501",
      "text": "for a missing space explorer."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:17,535",
      "end": "00:30:19,470",
      "text": "Together, with their trusty robot..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:19,503",
      "end": "00:30:21,639",
      "text": "- That's me. - Mm-hmm, yes."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:21,672",
      "end": "00:30:23,608",
      "text": "They follow the trail across four planets."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:23,641",
      "end": "00:30:26,111",
      "text": "There's a planet of war, a planet of love,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:26,144",
      "end": "00:30:28,146",
      "text": "a one of despair and one of joy."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:28,180",
      "end": "00:30:31,515",
      "text": "And each planet will have its own spectacular musical number"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:31,549",
      "end": "00:30:34,152",
      "text": "performed by one of our terrific cast."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:34,186",
      "end": "00:30:36,587",
      "text": "A-And how does it end? Do I find the explorer?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:36,621",
      "end": "00:30:39,157",
      "text": "Oh, we have no clue what we're going to do at the end."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:39,191",
      "end": "00:30:40,725",
      "text": "Gunter, no, no, no. Whoa, whoa, whoa."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:40,758",
      "end": "00:30:43,494",
      "text": "We do have great ideas for the ending."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:43,527",
      "end": "00:30:44,962",
      "text": "We just... All right."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:44,996",
      "end": "00:30:47,099",
      "text": "We've only got three weeks to make this reality, folks."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:47,132",
      "end": "00:30:48,499",
      "text": "Let's get to work."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:48,532",
      "end": "00:30:50,568",
      "text": "Johnny, you are gonna play"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:50,601",
      "end": "00:30:53,037",
      "text": "an alien warrior in a fantastic battle scene."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:30:53,071",
      "end": "00:30:54,872",
      "text": "- Yes! - Come with me."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:02,480",
      "end": "00:31:04,649",
      "text": "Johnny, I want you to meet your fellow dancers."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:04,682",
      "end": "00:31:06,817",
      "text": "- Hello, lads. - Hey, how you doing?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:06,851",
      "end": "00:31:08,819",
      "text": "Uh, wait. You said mine was a battle scene."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:08,853",
      "end": "00:31:12,090",
      "text": "Well, it is, but Gunter saw it as more of a... a dance battle."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:12,124",
      "end": "00:31:14,059",
      "text": "- Yeah! - Okay..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:14,092",
      "end": "00:31:15,960",
      "text": "Johnny, don't worry. You're gonna be working with"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:15,993",
      "end": "00:31:18,196",
      "text": "the number one choreographer in Redshore City."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:18,230",
      "end": "00:31:21,499",
      "text": "\"Klaus Kickenklober.\""
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:21,532",
      "end": "00:31:23,768",
      "text": "Yep. Klaus will turn you into a pro in no time."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:23,801",
      "end": "00:31:24,969",
      "text": "- Okay. - Uh..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:25,002",
      "end": "00:31:26,938",
      "text": "Mr. Moon?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:26,971",
      "end": "00:31:28,673",
      "text": "Meena, you okay?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:28,706",
      "end": "00:31:32,510",
      "text": "Gunter said I'm in a romantic scene and, uh, uh..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:32,543",
      "end": "00:31:34,545",
      "text": "I have to kiss someone."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:34,578",
      "end": "00:31:36,214",
      "text": "Yeah. It's gonna be an amazing,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:36,248",
      "end": "00:31:37,949",
      "text": "beautiful, romantic scene."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:37,982",
      "end": "00:31:39,717",
      "text": "Mr. Moon, I've never even had"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:39,750",
      "end": "00:31:41,519",
      "text": "a boyfriend or any of that stuff."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:41,552",
      "end": "00:31:42,787",
      "text": "Ah, don't you worry."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:42,820",
      "end": "00:31:45,057",
      "text": "I'm gonna cast a great partner for you."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:45,090",
      "end": "00:31:46,724",
      "text": "- Promise? - Promise."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:46,757",
      "end": "00:31:48,726",
      "text": "Mr. Moon, we're ready to start building"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:48,759",
      "end": "00:31:50,594",
      "text": "the rest of the sets and..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:50,628",
      "end": "00:31:51,963",
      "text": "Okay, okay, okay, listen."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:51,996",
      "end": "00:31:53,931",
      "text": "I don't exactly know what they are yet,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:53,965",
      "end": "00:31:56,901",
      "text": "so could you give me one more night to figure this out?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:56,934",
      "end": "00:31:59,003",
      "text": "Hey, this guy doesn't have it figured out,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:31:59,036",
      "end": "00:32:00,972",
      "text": "so we can't start work right now."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:01,005",
      "end": "00:32:02,240",
      "text": "Mason?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:02,274",
      "end": "00:32:03,708",
      "text": "- Did everybody hear that? - Hey, don't..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:03,741",
      "end": "00:32:05,177",
      "text": "He does not have the show figured out."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:05,210",
      "end": "00:32:06,944",
      "text": "I'm looking into his eyes,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:06,978",
      "end": "00:32:08,980",
      "text": "- and all I see is fear. - Uh-uh. Mm-mm."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:09,013",
      "end": "00:32:10,282",
      "text": "Hey, hey, hey, listen, listen..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:10,315",
      "end": "00:32:11,816",
      "text": "- And a little bit of shame. - Yeah, yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:11,849",
      "end": "00:32:13,851",
      "text": "Look, I-I think everyone heard you, Mason."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:13,884",
      "end": "00:32:14,852",
      "text": "Thank you so much."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:14,885",
      "end": "00:32:16,954",
      "text": "Gunter... we have work to do."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:16,988",
      "end": "00:32:19,790",
      "text": "And then I'm thinking, Ash, you know, she can, like,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:19,824",
      "end": "00:32:21,926",
      "text": "totally have a duet with Clay Calloway,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:21,959",
      "end": "00:32:24,862",
      "text": "'cause, like, she's a star that is, like,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:24,895",
      "end": "00:32:27,265",
      "text": "guiding them all the way back home again."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:27,299",
      "end": "00:32:29,800",
      "text": "Yes, Gunter. That's perfect for Ash."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:31,136",
      "end": "00:32:33,604",
      "text": "Mommy!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:33,637",
      "end": "00:32:35,806",
      "text": "Oh, my darlings, you're here."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:35,840",
      "end": "00:32:36,907",
      "text": "Yeah, Johnny!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:36,941",
      "end": "00:32:38,642",
      "text": "Oh."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:38,676",
      "end": "00:32:40,845",
      "text": "My gosh, I wasn't expecting you till the morning."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:40,878",
      "end": "00:32:43,181",
      "text": "I know, but they couldn't wait to see you."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:43,215",
      "end": "00:32:45,016",
      "text": "The star of the show, huh?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:45,049",
      "end": "00:32:46,584",
      "text": "Can you believe it?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:46,617",
      "end": "00:32:48,120",
      "text": "It's literally my dream come true."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:48,153",
      "end": "00:32:50,322",
      "text": "- I know. Mwah. - Ew."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:50,355",
      "end": "00:32:52,556",
      "text": "I am so proud of you, honey."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:53,924",
      "end": "00:32:55,160",
      "text": "Uh... help."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:55,193",
      "end": "00:32:57,828",
      "text": "Mr. Moon, I found him."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:32:57,862",
      "end": "00:33:00,598",
      "text": "- Clay Calloway? - Yeah. I found his home address."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:00,631",
      "end": "00:33:02,267",
      "text": "No way."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:02,300",
      "end": "00:33:03,768",
      "text": "Yes way."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:03,801",
      "end": "00:33:05,237",
      "text": "Miss Crawly, I'm gonna need you"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:05,270",
      "end": "00:33:06,804",
      "text": "to go visit him first thing tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:06,837",
      "end": "00:33:08,672",
      "text": "- Oh, yes, sir. - You'll need to rent a car"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:08,706",
      "end": "00:33:11,042",
      "text": "and take him a letter and, uh, maybe that fruit basket."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:11,076",
      "end": "00:33:12,144",
      "text": "Yes, the fruit basket."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:12,177",
      "end": "00:33:13,644",
      "text": "- You got that? - Got it."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:14,812",
      "end": "00:33:17,082",
      "text": "And one, two, three, four,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:17,115",
      "end": "00:33:19,184",
      "text": "five, six, seven, eight."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:19,217",
      "end": "00:33:21,053",
      "text": "We're dancing. We're dancing."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:21,086",
      "end": "00:33:23,020",
      "text": "We're holding. We're holding."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:23,055",
      "end": "00:33:24,322",
      "text": "Stay en pointe."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:24,356",
      "end": "00:33:26,724",
      "text": "Shuffle and hold."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:26,757",
      "end": "00:33:29,361",
      "text": "I said hold, Johnny. He's not holding."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:29,394",
      "end": "00:33:31,829",
      "text": "- And one, two, three, four... - All right, I'm... I am trying."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:31,862",
      "end": "00:33:35,666",
      "text": "Let's not forget, this is Redshore City,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:35,699",
      "end": "00:33:37,202",
      "text": "not your little local theater."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:37,235",
      "end": "00:33:39,337",
      "text": "And five, six, seven, eight."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:33:39,371",
      "end": "00:33:41,206",
